sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Registry Anchor resolution sequence
  accDescr: A consumer requests a resolved Anchor, the Registry loads the DOT and optional Contract, resolves the selected element, and returns a versioned read-only response.
  autonumber
  actor Consumer
  participant API as AnchorController
  participant Dots as DotRepository
  participant Contracts as Contract store
  participant Resolver as Contract resolver

  Consumer->>API: GET resolved Anchor
  API->>Dots: Load DOT and embedded Anchor
  Dots-->>API: DOT and Anchor
  alt Contract-backed Anchor
    API->>Contracts: Load Contract by UUID
    Contracts-->>API: Authoritative Contract
    API->>Resolver: Resolve selector by Contract standard
    Resolver-->>API: Normalized selected element
  else Contractless Anchor
    API->>API: Use Anchor-declared interaction facts
  end
  API-->>Consumer: ResolvedAnchorResponse v1
  Note over API,Resolver: Read-only resolution, with no runtime endpoint or credential lookup
